      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would like Avatar sorting for this reason. Filters and faster avatar preview load times. We've loaded them before, shouldn't they still be in cache?\n\nAtop this, why is it that I have to 'Avatar' menu sets? Every second time I go to my Avatar list, it shows me my first avatar/s, but otherwise it shows my most recent?\nI think these could be fixed by simply adding folders and being able to section each avatar off with criteria.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-09-10T07:06:18.404Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This may sound weird, but just a thought. Sometimes you have some avatars that you figure you'll stick on a pedestal to let people use.\n\nbut then you realize that while you want to keep them on a pedestal, they are cluttering your avatar list.\n\nIt would be nice if there was a way to have avatars be uploaded but not show up on your avatar list, for clutter cleanup's sake. So i can put my avatar on a pedestal, without it taking up room on a list that already has too many avatars.",
